 Patch Name: Spacey life
     Author: Jonas Nordin
   Comments: An effect, sounds a bit like Steve Vai's Ballerina 12/24
 
 PROGRAM CHANGE NO. B: 23
 
 SEQUENCE BLOCK A       152346
 SEQUENCE BLOCK B       134256
 
 BLOCK A - ON/OFF       15***6
 BLOCK B - ON/OFF       ***256
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-1 COMPRESSOR
 
    TONE 0
  ATTACK 20
 SUSTAIN 80
   LEVEL 50
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-5 PARAMETRIC EQ
 
    HI FREQ 8.00 kHz
   HI LEVEL +11.0 dB
 
   H.M.FREQ 2.98 kHz
     H.M. Q 1.0
 H.M. LEVEL +0.5 dB
 
  L.M. FREQ 535 Hz
     L.M. Q 1.0
 L.M. LEVEL +3.5 dB
 
    LO FREQ 250 Hz
   LO LEVEL +1.5 dB
 
  OUT LEVEL +5.5 dB
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-6 NOISE SUPPRESSOR
 
    SENS 32
 RELEASE 0
   LEVEL 100
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-2 
         c. PITCH SHIFTER
 
   BAL. E. 100
   BAL. D. 0
 CHROMATIC +7
      FINE 0
    F.BACK 60
   P.DELAY 40 msec
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-5 REVERB
 
 DECAY 1.8 sec
 
 MODE: ROOM 2
 
    CUTOFF THRU
 PRE DELAY 29 msec
  E. LEVEL 38
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-6 LINEOUT FILTER
 
 PRESENCE 10
   TREBLE 80
   MIDDLE 82
     BASS 50
 
 ----------------------------------
 MASTER VOLUME 75
 
 ----------------------------------
 EXPRESSION PEDAL
 
 ASSIGN OFF

 ----------------------------------
 OUTPUT SELECT
 
 CHANNEL  1

